{"type":"message","id":"01471cb9","parentId":"ae384166","timestamp":"2026-03-04T08:19:54.612Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-04 16:19 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 2/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: ## Task: 验证 ParMETIS 优化后的正确性和性能\n\n## Workspace: /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter\n\n## Context\ncode-agent 完成了三项优化：\n1. P0-1: 修复 `distribute()` 负载均衡问题 - 使用向下取整+余数分配\n2. P0-2: 重构 Interface 通信 - 稀疏点对点通信 + 二进制序列化\n3. P1-3: Interface 数据结构优化 - 使用 hash 替代字符串\n\n## Requirements\n\n### 环境设置\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\nsource ../env.sh\nexport PATH=$MPI_ROOT/bin:$PATH\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$CGNS_ROOT/lib:$METIS_ROOT/lib:$PARMETIS_ROOT/lib:$MPI_ROOT/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH\n```\n\n### 测试步骤\n\n**1. 编译验证**\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\ncmake .. && make -j4\n```\n\n**2. 基础功能测试**\n```bash\n# 2进程分割4分区\nmpirun -n 2 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 4\n\n# 验证输出文件\nls -la decomposed_mesh_*.cgns\n```\n\n**3. 边界测试**\n```bash\n# 2进程分割8分区\nmpirun -n 2 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 8\n\n# 4进程分割4分区\nmpirun -n 4 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 4\n```\n\n**4. CFD 模拟验证** (关键测试)\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\n\n# 运行 ACT CFD 模拟\nmpirun -n 2 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n\n# 检查收敛日志\n# 注意: CFD 收敛变慢是正常的，无需修复\n# 只需确认模拟能正常运行并收敛\n```\n\n**5. 性能对比** (可选)\n如果可能，记录：\n- 分割时间\n- 内存使用\n- Interface 通信数据量\n\n### 验证标准\n- [ ] 编译成功\n- [ ] 网格分割正常运行\n- [ ] 输出文件完整\n- [ ] CFD 模拟收敛\n\n## Deliverable\n测试报告，包含：\n1. 编译状态\n2. 功能测试结果\n3. CFD 模拟收敛状态\n4. 发现的问题（如果有）\n\n## Report To: $HOME/.openclaw-reports/test-agent/"}],"timestamp":1772612394610}}
